BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Use Days 22-30 to close evidence gaps and make an explicit allocation decision. The targets below are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (proposed management thresholds for this launch, not outputs attributed to the scorecard engine. Count) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (each customer once and preserve the original fifty-contact cohort so additional outreach cannot disguise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (weak conversion. By Day 30, seek six qualified audits, three written proposals, and one accepted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (engagement. An accepted audit can remain unpaid until its agreed success event; record that distinction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Authorize a bounded next cohort only with one paid customer, at least $1,000 of retained fee cash collected,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (positive pilot contribution, complete authorization evidence, and zero uncovered annual commitments.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (Otherwise choose Fix when at least three qualified audits and two dated decision meetings support another) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (thirty days of work. Choose Kill for the tested route when fifty permitted contacts plus ten completed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (discovery conversations produce zero qualified audits, or no authorized commercial route exists after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (documented partner follow-up. Insufficient sample size triggers a bounded Fix, not a claim that the market) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (failed. Any unauthorized fulfillment or uncovered commitment stops new orders immediately, regardless of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (sales momentum. Kill means stop new acquisition for that route while honoring existing customer and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (supplier obligations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (Keep Day 1-30 gross operating and setup disbursements at or below $2,500, leaving the original $2,500) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (reserve untouched. Customer subscription pass-throughs sit outside that operating measure but require) Tj ET
